abstract: >-
  Reads the public record on UAE and Abu Dhabi AI targets, grades how checkable each commitment is,
  traces every status to a source, and shows how much a headline percentage depends on its definition.
  Prototype; not an official product of any government entity.
keywords: [AI governance, verifiability, UAE, public sector]
